WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.450
Welcome back, champ!

2
00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:13.650
Last time: certain · likely · unlikely · impossible

3
00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:19.180
Chapter 3 · Working Backwards

4
00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:28.170
Know the end? Walk back to the start!

5
00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:39.550
Meet Kabir and his tiffin of laddoos

6
00:00:39.550 --> 00:00:45.880
Zoya gives him 4 more. Now he has 12!

7
00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:59.290
How many did he have at the start? Think!

8
00:00:59.290 --> 00:01:09.620
We know the end (12) and the step (+4)

9
00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:17.120
Working backwards: start at the end, undo steps

10
00:01:17.120 --> 00:01:21.610
Useful when you know the end, not the start

11
00:01:21.610 --> 00:01:31.060
Like rewinding a replay

12
00:01:31.060 --> 00:01:41.850
Draw it: ? → +4 → 12

13
00:01:41.850 --> 00:01:50.790
Reverse the arrow: +4 becomes −4

14
00:01:50.790 --> 00:01:56.250
12 − 4 = 8. Kabir started with 8!

15
00:01:56.250 --> 00:02:04.730
Check forwards: 8 + 4 = 12. Yes!

16
00:02:04.730 --> 00:02:13.790
Undo = do the opposite. Add 5 ↔ subtract 5

17
00:02:13.790 --> 00:02:19.250
Got · found · bought → undo by subtracting

18
00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:25.230
Lost · gave away · ate → undo by adding

19
00:02:25.230 --> 00:02:34.810
Doubled → undo by halving

20
00:02:34.810 --> 00:02:46.210
Got 20 rupees, now has 50. How much before?

21
00:02:46.210 --> 00:02:58.780
50 − 20 = 30 rupees. Check: 30 + 20 = 50. Yes!

22
00:02:58.780 --> 00:03:11.040
Gave away 5, now has 10. How many at first?

23
00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:19.440
10 + 5 = 15 marbles

24
00:03:19.440 --> 00:03:23.150
Detective game: spot the mistake!

25
00:03:23.150 --> 00:03:33.660
"To undo gave away 3, subtract 3." Right?

26
00:03:33.660 --> 00:03:44.700
No! Undo gave away 3 by ADDING 3 back

27
00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:55.700
Got 6, gave away 4, now has 10. Start?

28
00:03:55.700 --> 00:04:08.920
Undo the LAST step first, like shoes then socks

29
00:04:08.920 --> 00:04:23.490
10 + 4 = 14, then 14 − 6 = 8

30
00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:36.720
Check: 8 + 6 = 14, 14 − 4 = 10. Yes!

31
00:04:36.720 --> 00:04:51.630
? → +7 → double → 30. What's the number?

32
00:04:51.630 --> 00:04:59.260
Undo double: half of 30 is 15

33
00:04:59.260 --> 00:05:08.160
Undo +7: 15 − 7 = 8

34
00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:15.820
Check: 8 + 7 = 15, double 15 = 30. Yes!

35
00:05:15.820 --> 00:05:22.780
Working backwards = the Undo button

36
00:05:22.780 --> 00:05:34.130
Tree → sun → scribble. Undo: scribble goes!

37
00:05:34.130 --> 00:05:43.170
Undo again: the sun goes. Last step first!

38
00:05:43.170 --> 00:05:46.870
Your turn: practice check

39
00:05:46.870 --> 00:05:58.060
9 stickers after losing 3. How many at start?

40
00:05:58.060 --> 00:06:09.670
9 + 3 = 12. Check: 12 − 3 = 9. Yes!

41
00:06:09.670 --> 00:06:15.950
Know the end? Work backwards

42
00:06:15.950 --> 00:06:23.340
Add ↔ subtract · Double ↔ halve

43
00:06:23.340 --> 00:06:26.270
Undo the last step first

44
00:06:26.270 --> 00:06:29.480
Check your answer going forwards

45
00:06:29.480 --> 00:06:36.390
Chapter 3 done!

46
00:06:36.390 --> 00:06:43.190
Next: Quiz · Tap Finish
